strong> (National Doubles) do sul do pa\u00eds, realizada no moderno complexo indoor da <strong>Portim\u00e3o Arena<\/strong>, no concelho de <strong>Portim\u00e3o<\/strong> (distrito de <strong>Faro<\/strong>). Seguindo os padr\u00f5es internacionais do formato HYROX, a prova re\u00fane duplas masculinas, femininas e mistas num desafio supremo de resist\u00eancia e for\u00e7a.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A competi\u00e7\u00e3o divide-se em <strong>8 rondas de 800 metros de corrida<\/strong> intercaladas com <strong>8 esta\u00e7\u00f5es funcionais<\/strong> de alta intensidade (SkiErg, Sled Push, Sled Pull, Burpee Broad Jumps, Remo Concept2, Farmer Carry, Sandbag Lunges e Wall Balls). Com arbitragem rigorosa da <strong>VORTEX<\/strong>, cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica com chips individuais, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica e medalha finisher em metal fundido, o evento consagra os atletas mais completos do desporto h\u00edbrido.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(